<title>USA: J&amp;L says Kronk to retire as chief executive.</title>
<headline>J&amp;L says Kronk to retire as chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Claude Kronk, vice chairman and chief executive of J&amp;L Specialty Steel Inc, will retire as chief executive at the end of the year, said J&amp;L Chairman Philippe Choppin de Janvry.</p>
<p>Janvry made the announcement at the annual meeting Tuesday.</p>
<p>Janvry said Kronk, 65, will remain vice chairman and a member of the board. He said a new chief executive will be elected by the board later this year.</p>
<p>((Pittsburgh newsroom 412-471-7088))</p>
